(### 1.1 MSE ? Mean Squared Error) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(#### Simple Hinglish intuition) Tj
0 -14 Td
(MSE batata hai ki model average mein kitna squared error kar raha hai. Pehle actual aur) Tj
0 -14 Td
(predicted ka difference nikaalte hain, phir square karte hain, aur phir average lete) Tj
0 -14 Td
(hain. Square karne ki wajah se bade errors ko zyada punishment milti hai.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(#### Formula) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(\\[) Tj
0 -14 Td
(MSE = \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{i=1}^{n}\(y_i - \\hat{y}_i\)^2) Tj
0 -14 Td
(\\]) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(#### Terms) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `n`: number of observations) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `y_i`: actual value) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `\\hat{y}_i`: predicted value) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `\(y_i - \\hat{y}_i\)`: prediction error) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(#### Step-by-step example) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Squared errors:) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `\(-10\)^2 = 100`) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `\(5\)^2 = 25`) Tj
