(### 1.4 R Score ? Coefficient of Determination) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(#### Simple Hinglish intuition) Tj
0 -14 Td
(R batata hai ki model ne target variable ki variability ka kitna hissa explain kiya.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(`1` means perfect fit, `0` means baseline mean predictor jaisa performance, and negative) Tj
0 -14 Td
(means baseline se bhi worse.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(#### Formula) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(\\[) Tj
0 -14 Td
(R^2 = 1 - \\frac{\\sum \(y_i - \\hat{y}_i\)^2}{\\sum \(y_i - \\bar{y}\)^2}) Tj
0 -14 Td
(\\]) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(#### Terms) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- `\\bar{y}`: mean of actual values) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- numerator: unexplained variation \(RSS\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(- denominator: total variation \(TSS\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(#### Step-by-step example) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Mean of actuals:) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(\\[) Tj
0 -14 Td
